    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reading the response",
     "texto": [
      "A response should state what was checked, what measure will be taken and within what time frame. **Sehari** means \"one day\"; it is formed with **se-** and a unit of time."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Closing politely",
     "texto": [
      "Thank them for the response and keep the case details. If the solution does not arrive, you can politely ask for an update."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
